<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 0.85 to 640.20, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.02.</p>
<p>Declines beat advances 280 to 271.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 30,095,910 compared with 27,110,100 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
